Structure, Transfer of Shares and Amalgamation of Insurers) Regulations, 2024;
iii. Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India (Expenses of
Management, including Commission, of Insurers) Regulations, 2024;
iv. Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India (Actuarial, Finance and
Investment Functions of Insurers) Regulations, 2024;
v. Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India (Corporate Governance for
